{"ID":"20240220132627-f1oay3t","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240220132627-f1oay3t","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240220132627-f1oay3t\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312163523-0r650q3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312163523-qnxgg2a\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312163523-qnxgg2a\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:120,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:120\u0026#125;","title":"【文蛤散】","type":"doc","updated":"20240312163523"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240312163523-0r650q3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163523-0r650q3","updated":"20240312163523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第一百五十五条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312163523-x6ii0qm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163523-x6ii0qm","updated":"20240312163523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：病在阳,应以汗解之,反以冷水潠之,若灌之,其热被却不得去,弥更益烦,肉上粟起,意欲饮水,反不渴者,服「文蛤散」；若不差者,与「五苓散」。"}]},{"ID":"20240312163523-khkyjpn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163523-khkyjpn","updated":"20240312163523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"病在阳，病在表。应该用汗解，被冷水浇，还没发表，你没有用冷水刺激他的时候，热还在表面上，你用冷水刺激他，发的更厉害，肉上粟起,皮肤上起鸡皮圪塔起来。想要饮水,反不渴者。这种情形，服「文蛤散」；文蛤散方是很轻的一个剂。"}]},{"ID":"20240312163523-q6ehwna","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163523-q6ehwna","updated":"20240312163523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这里是说当你用汗剂发表，发不出来。有的人皮肤很紧，毛孔天生很紧。前面讲过，用麻黄汤三钱下去一滴汗都不流，五钱还是不流，你问他小便有没有，小便比以前多很多，他已经好了。因为他表太实了，毛孔太小。如果你开下去没流汗也没有小便，张仲景意思是皮肤紧，恶寒、起鸡皮疙瘩，这种人表很实，不要用麻黄汤了，用利尿剂利出来，五苓散就是可以把表水，皮肤表面的，皮肤和肌肉中间的水统统导出来。如何"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"喝了文蛤散没用可以用五苓散"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240312163523-caz1c2j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163523-caz1c2j","updated":"20240312163523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"文蛤散方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312163523-z8x4nug","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163523-z8x4nug","updated":"20240312163523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"文蛤五两"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312163523-apanze3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163523-apanze3","updated":"20240312163523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右一味,为散,以沸汤和一钱匕服,汤用五合。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312163523-qnxgg2a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312163523-qnxgg2a","updated":"20240312163523"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"文蛤散是很轻的剂，经法在使用蛤蜊壳的时候，有一个是牡蛎。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"牡蛎咸，能软坚。所以甲状腺肿瘤，我们用牡蛎去攻它，腋下淋巴也在用牡蛎。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"菜市场有血蛤，壳面像屋瓦，翻开里面都是血红红的，那个壳就是瓦楞子。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"瓦楞子也是攻坚用的，因为长得很像乳房，取它的象"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]}]}